---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Voco Speech"
  description="Privacy Policy for Voco Speech. 100% on-device processing."
>
  <Navbar />
  
  <main data-analytics-section="page" id="main-content" class="min-h-[75vh] bg-[#fbf9f5] py-8 sm:py-12 md:py-20 border-b border-[#e5e0d4]">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <!-- Breadcrumb -->
      <nav class="mb-4 sm:mb-6 flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#5c5b56]">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-[#141413] transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-[#141413]">Privacy Policy</span>
      </nav>

      <!-- Page Header with Rebus Divider -->
      <div class="mb-8 sm:mb-10 pb-6 border-b border-[#e5e0d4]">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#5c5b56] uppercase tracking-wider block mb-2">
          // Legal & Data Protection
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#141413] tracking-tight uppercase" style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#5c5b56] mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          Last updated: October 2026 • Speech processing stays on your device.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Editorial Card -->
      <div class="bg-white border-2 border-[#141413] rebus-stamp-shadow p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-10 space-y-6">
        
        <div class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5c5b56] leading-relaxed">
          <div class="p-4 bg-[#fbf9f5] border border-[#141413]">
            <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#141413] mb-1">
              1. 100% On-Device Processing
            </h2>
            <p>
              All speech generation and voice cloning run locally inside your browser threads. Your microphone audio, text entered for speech generation, and generated speech files are never transmitted to our servers or stored in the cloud.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 bg-[#fbf9f5] border border-[#141413]">
            <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#141413] mb-1">
              2. Usage Analytics
            </h2>
            <p>
              We use Google Analytics to understand page visits, button use, sections viewed, and whether loading, recording, and speech generation succeed. Google Analytics may use cookies and collect browser, device, and usage information. You do not need an account to use Voco Speech.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-2">
              Our analytics events exclude your speech text, custom voice names, recordings, generated audio, feedback messages, and contact details. We remove query strings and fragments from the page addresses sent by our analytics code. Analytics is disabled on local development pages and when supported browser privacy signals request an opt-out.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 bg-[#fbf9f5] border border-[#141413]">
            <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#141413] mb-1">
              3. Microphone Access
            </h2>
            <p>
              Your browser requests microphone permission solely for live recording when you choose to clone a voice. The stream closes immediately when you stop recording.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 bg-[#fbf9f5] border border-[#141413]">
            <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#141413] mb-1">
              4. Saved Voices
            </h2>
            <p>
              Custom voice profiles are saved exclusively on your computer in your browser's private database (IndexedDB). You can delete them anytime from the Workspace.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-[#fbf9f5] border border-[#141413]">
            <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#141413] mb-1">5. Feedback You Choose to Submit</h2>
            <p>If you submit a suggestion, its message, topic, and optional attribution are sent to our Google Forms feedback form. A backup may also be saved in your browser. Feedback content and attribution are not included in analytics events.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-[#e5e0d4] flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs">
          <span class="text-[#5c5b56]">Questions about our privacy architecture?</span>
          <a href="mailto:hi@vocospeech.xyz" class="font-bold text-[#141413] underline font-mono">
            hi@vocospeech.xyz →
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
